    "Desktop": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "桌面端"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Diagnostics": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "诊断信息"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dismiss": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "移除卡片"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Display": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "显示器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything here can be changed later in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这里的每一项以后都能在设置里改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything stays on this Mac": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一切都留在这台 Mac 上"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Export diagnostics": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "导出诊断信息"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Files and sound packs": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文件与音效包"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Find sessions by reading the agents' own session logs": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通过读取代理自己的会话日志来发现会话"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Finished": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已完成"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Finished and waiting for you": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已完成，正在等你"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Follow the menu bar": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "跟随菜单栏"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Following the menu bar, the island slides away with the desktop and comes down when you push the pointer to the top of the screen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "跟随菜单栏时，小岛会随桌面一起滑走；把指针推到屏幕顶端，它会和菜单栏一起降下来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For sessions at work and for the things you can press.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用于“工作中”状态和可以点按的地方。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "From anywhere, without the pointer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在任何地方都能用，不必动鼠标。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Full-screen apps": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "全屏应用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "General": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Get started": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开始"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Has a question for you": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有问题需要你回答"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hello": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你好"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hit an error": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "出错了"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hooks cannot start the bridge until the flag is cleared. Run this once in a terminal, then reopen the app:": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在清除隔离标记之前，钩子无法启动桥接程序。请在终端里执行一次下面的命令，然后重新打开应用："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How fast it opens and closes": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "展开与收起的速度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How it looks and behaves": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "外观与行为"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How long the notice stays": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提示停留多久"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How long the pointer has to rest": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "指针需要停留多久"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of a plan is used up is known to the provider, not to this Mac (Codex is the exception: it writes its limits into its own session files). Each switch below asks one provider, with your own sign-in, and keeps nothing but percentages and reset times. Both are off until you turn them on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "套餐用了多少，只有厂商知道，这台 Mac 上并没有记录（Codex 例外：它会把额度写进自己的会话文件）。下面每个开关只向一家厂商查询，用的是你自己的登录凭据，只保留百分比和恢复时间。两个开关默认都是关闭的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How soon it closes after the pointer leaves": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "指针离开后多久收起"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install one, then connect it from Settings. The island also finds Claude Code, Codex and ZCode sessions by itself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先安装一个，再到设置里接入。小岛也会自己发现 Claude Code、Codex 和 ZCode 的会话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Island": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "岛屿"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Island and 8-bit are generated by the app itself; no audio files are bundled.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“岛屿”和“8-bit”两套音效由应用自己合成，没有打包任何音频文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It closes again when the pointer leaves.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "指针离开后会自动收起。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It never takes keyboard focus away from what you are typing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它不会抢走你正在输入的键盘焦点。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep a quiet session listed for": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安静的会话保留"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep the island visible when nothing is running": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有会话时也保持岛屿可见"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Language": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "语言"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Language, startup, notifications": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "语言、启动与通知"
          }
        }
      }
